UnRAR EXCEPTION
================================================================================

As a special exception, LumiBear Studio, the copyright holder of this program,
gives you permission to link this program with the UnRAR code -- reached through
the `unrar` and `unrar_sys` crates, which embed UnRAR sources
(C) Alexander Roshal -- and to distribute the resulting combined work, provided
that you also comply with the UnRAR license terms for the UnRAR portions.

This exception is necessary because the UnRAR license is NOT compatible with the
GNU GPL: it forbids using the UnRAR sources to develop or re-create the RAR
compression algorithm, which is a restriction the GPL does not allow to be
imposed on recipients. The exception exists solely so that the combined work may
be distributed, and it follows the approach 7-Zip uses ("GNU LGPL with unRAR
restriction").

OtterZip uses UnRAR to EXTRACT RAR archives only. OtterZip never creates RAR
archives, and the UnRAR code in this project must not be used to develop or
re-create the RAR compression algorithm.

If you modify this program, you may extend this exception to your version of the
program, but you are not obliged to do so. If you do not wish to do so, delete
this exception statement from your version.

